;
; How Damper files one room of the building tree in MYRA (damper_rules.h
; DR5): a sparse record under the floor and the room, with the room the
; way out leads to next (toward, 0 for outside) and how many doors of the
; room open straight outside (exits). The model asks whether the numbers
; fit before it keeps the room.
^ZXDAMPER(floor:i2, room:i3) = toward:i3! ^ exits:i1!
